commit f8645d9fe8791b89ad6e44cd4cfa8c66a2e504eb
Author: Chris <zhangjim117@163.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 21 16:46:30 2026 +0800

    feat: source-channel prompt tags, channel status rail, and fork branding
    
    - Tag inbound prompts with channel labels so agents can attribute work across channels (e.g. unified work logs); wired opt-in via runtime/production options so existing tests keep default behavior
    
    - Settings page: connection status dot per channel in the rail plus connected/offline/unconfigured summary, polled from connection.status
    
    - Reorder channels by actual usage (feishu/dingtalk/wecom first) and default-select Feishu
    
    - Point the header GitHub link at the personal fork; keep the settings.section top-level registration

